msgctxt "MEDIA3/ARC/DAY/DAY_KAB0003.ARC/TALK_ST_KAB0003.BIN::line:287_1_4"
msgid "They're all so shallow!{PA:20}||How can they be so completely shameless?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA3/ARC/DAY/DAY_KAB0003.ARC/TALK_ST_KAB0003.BIN::line:287_1_5"
msgid "Deep down,{PA:10} though,{PA:10} they're all just lonely.{PA:20}||They're terrified of being alone.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA3/ARC/DAY/DAY_KAB0003.ARC/TALK_ST_KAB0003.BIN::line:287_1_6"
msgid "So they go through the motions of trying to||act all sexy.{PA:20} It's just sad.{PA:20}"
