msgctxt "MEDIA3/ARC/DAY/DAY_KAB0003.ARC/TALK_ST_KAB0003.BIN::line:288_1_7"
msgid "Damn,{PA:10} I'm jealous!{PA:20} Wonder if it'll happen||again this year.{PA:20}"
