msgctxt "MEDIA3/ARC/DAY/DAY_KAB0003.ARC/TALK_ST_KAB0003.BIN::line:288_1_9"
msgid "H-Hey,{PA:10} hold up!{PA:20}||More cash could come raining down anytime.{PA:20}"
